---
title: "end (LegionPreLiquidOpenApplicationSale)"
---
stateDiagram-v2
    direction TB
    [*] --> q_check_auth: end()
    q_check_auth --> q_check_not_ended: caller is Legion operator OR projectAdmin
    q_check_auth --> q_revert_auth: unauthorized
    q_check_not_ended --> q_set_ended: hasEnded == false
    q_check_not_ended --> q_revert_ended: sale already ended
    q_set_ended --> q_set_times: hasEnded = true, endTime = block.timestamp
    q_set_times --> q_emit: refundEndTime = block.timestamp + refundPeriodSeconds
    q_emit --> [*]: emit SaleConcluded(endTime, refundEndTime)
    q_revert_auth --> [*]: revert UnauthorizedAccess
    q_revert_ended --> [*]: revert SaleAlreadyEnded

    note right of q_set_times
        INV-001: endTime and refundEndTime computed at conclusion time
        INV-002: refundPeriodSeconds is global (unlike PreLiquidApproved per-investor)
        INV-003: invest() disabled after end()
    end note
